  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Billed Cost > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L011: \"BilledCost MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L013: \"BilledCost MUST be of type Decimal.\"",
    "  L014: \"BilledCost MUST conform to [NumericFormat](#attributes.numericformat) requirements.\"",
    "  L015: \"BilledCost MUST NOT be null.\"",
    "  L016: \"BilledCost MUST be denominated in the BillingCurrency.\"",
    "  L017: \"BilledCost MUST reflect all applicable pricing adjustments, including but not limited to *negotiated discounts*, *commitment discounts*, and other applicable discount programs.\"",
    "  L018: \"BilledCost MUST NOT include any portion of a [*covered charge*](#glossary:covered-charge) that is offset by a [*covering charge*](#glossary:covering-charge).\"",
    "  L019: \"BilledCost MUST be 0 for *charges* that are fully *covered* by one or more *covering charges*.\"",
    "  L020: \"BilledCost MUST reflect amounts as invoiced by the [InvoiceIssuerName](#datasets.costandusage.invoiceissuername), not estimated or inferred values.\"",
    "  L021: \"BilledCost MUST be 0 for *charges* generated by entities that are not responsible or authorized for invoicing, to avoid double-counting when merging multiple datasets.\"",
    "  L022: \"The sum of BilledCost for a given [InvoiceId](#datasets.costandusage.invoiceid) and InvoiceIssuerName MUST NOT differ from the payable amount provided on the corresponding invoice by more than the [Rounding Variance Tolerance](#appendix.roundingvariancetolerance) when the corresponding invoice has been issued.\"",
    "  L023: \"The sum of BilledCost MAY differ from preliminary or estimated invoiced amounts when the corresponding invoice has not yet been issued.\""
  ],
